  "en": {
    "kind": "Double LP: original 1930s recordings and covers by other singers",
    "about": [
      "Second part of the Columbia/EMI series (1983), compiled by Dimitris Ranios. The first record holds Vamvakaris's own recordings from 1934–1935 (“Otan plyno toumbekaki” was recorded on 24 November 1933); the second has covers of his songs by Bithikotsis, Panou, Dionysiou, Grey, Grekka and others."
    ]
